1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,400
Taking orders on WhatsApp?

2
00:00:03,883 --> 00:00:06,513
Here's the order. Now find it.

3
00:00:06,767 --> 00:00:09,587
Who's handling it? Did anyone follow up?

4
00:00:09,407 --> 00:00:11,767
Give every order a place to live.

5
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,390
One: log it in one shared list.

6
00:00:14,433 --> 00:00:16,873
Two: assign it to one person.

7
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:20,750
Three: track the status, so nobody has to ask.

8
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,530
Four: follow up, with a name and a date.

9
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:26,810
Every order gets an owner, a status, and a next step.

10
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,360
Read the free guide on our blog.

